[TITLE]
Triggers legacy runtime warnings 05/06/07/08 (min slope, dry/routing step clamps,
elevation drop exceeds length). MIN_SLOPE forces a slope clamp; DRY_STEP < WET_STEP
and ROUTING_STEP > WET_STEP force the step clamps; the short conduit C2 forces the
elevation-drop-exceeds-length warning.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0.5
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:10:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         900

[JUNCTIONS]
J1       10    5         0          0         0
J2       10    5         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
O1       0     FREE         NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To   Length  Rough   In  Out  Init  Max
C1       J1    O1   400     0.01    0   0    0     0
C2       J2    O1   5       0.01    0   0    0     0

[XSECTIONS]
C1       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C2       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1

[COORDINATES]
J1  0    0
J2  0    50
O1  100  0
